Package: DTExploR
Title: Interactive Kaggle-Style Data Explorer Widget
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: Provides an interactive, Kaggle-style HTML widget for exploring
    data frames in R. Built on React (via 'reactR') and 'htmlwidgets', it
    offers column-type detection, multi-value filtering, sorting, column
    visibility toggling, virtual scrolling for large datasets, and a
    full-screen maximise mode. Widgets can be embedded in R Markdown / Quarto
    documents, Shiny applications, or exported to standalone HTML files for
    offline use and sharing via save_dtexplor().
